/// be between `{1}` and `{20}`, enabling the corresponding OpenType
/// feature(s) from `ss01` to `ss20`. Setting this to `{none}` will disable
/// all stylistic sets.
///
/// ```example
/// #set text(font: "IBM Plex Serif")
/// ß vs #text(stylistic-set: 5)[ß] \
